# Conformance probe pack (spec 0.34): `inner … partial` in a kind, most
# significant bit first. Public.
format     conformance-inner-kindspartial
version    0.34.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       bits
layout     sequential
bit_order  msb
kind carry
when     8  7
requires probe.n
field    probe.n  8  uint
inner    conformance-inner-seq  partial
kind plain
when     8  8
requires probe.w
field    probe.w  8  uint
